      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-06-17T16:52:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah it is super fun to play, or to watch people play! At first I was turned off by the idea of real time dice rolling as well as the monster truck theme, which I don't especially care about. However, this game as well as Bottom of the Ninth have really brought be around on the real time aspect, and all of the art and gameplay for MTM are so fun and exciting and just well done that I really enjoy it.</p>",
